{"id":"01a046af-4150-7791-b743-33814b2aa919","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-n9ik.5","event_type":"closed","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"","new_value":"The (0, 127) special case is already implemented at dodag.rs:90-93 with explicit test coverage in dodag_version_preserves_explicit_adjacent_restart_policy (lines 1115-1122). The test documents this as an intentional policy decision: lollipop_cmp(0,127) returns None per RFC literal text, but version_is_newer(0,127) returns true to handle the natural 127-\u003e0 wraparound in the circular region. The design decision was deliberately made and the RFC interpretation concern has been considered.","created_at":"2026-08-28T04:44:45.776497Z"}
